   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s039-u002",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வசந்தி",
    "text": "You have come, Swami? I was waiting on the garden rock—you have come by way of the palace.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-039.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-039.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s039-d001",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s039-u003",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "What does it matter which path... does the light change in your speech, in your honeyed eyes, Vasanthi!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-039.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-039.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s039-d002",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "semantic-poetic",
     "notes": [
      "The speech/eyes/light image is retained."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s039-u004",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "How could it change—Ahalya created for Indra—Tara created for Chandra—Vasantha created for Purushothaman—",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-039.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-039.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s039-d003",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "semantic-poetic",
     "notes": [
      "The mythological three-part self-comparison is retained without explanatory substitution."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s039-u005",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "Vasanthi! My dear... I do not even know what to say to you—",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-039.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-039.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s039-d004",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 62,
       "printed_page": 61
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s039-u006",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "Remain mute—I enjoy that elegance...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-039.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-039.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s039-d005",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 62,
       "printed_page": 61
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s039-u007",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "Now... whatever you ask, I shall give—",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-039.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-039.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s039-d006",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 62,
       "printed_page": 61
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s039-u008",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "There comes the danger!... Even what I had thought of asking, I am not going to ask now...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-039.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-039.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s039-d007",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 62,
       "printed_page": 61
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s039-u009",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "Why, Vasanthi!...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-039.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-039.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s039-d008",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 62,
       "printed_page": 61
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s039-u010",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "You will say, ‘The adventuress waited for the right moment to ask.’ Am I Kaikeyi who deceived Dasaratha?... No... no...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-039.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-039.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s039-d009",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 62,
       "printed_page": 61
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "Kaikeyi/Dasaratha remain explicit cultural references."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s039-u011",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "What is it, Vasanthi? Ask!...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-039.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-039.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s039-d010",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
